{#
compose/_settled_row.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
A message of the conversation once its send has settled, inside the frame the
worker's outcome stream put where it was being sent — see
ComposeController::settledRow() and mail/_send_outcome.stream.html.twig.

No `draft` override, unlike compose/_sent.stream.html.twig: by now the row
says what it is. Sent, the message renders open, the way a reply of one's own
joins the conversation; refused, it renders as the draft it is again.

Variables: message
#}
<turbo-frame id="settled_message_{{ message.id }}">
    {% include 'mail/_thread_message.html.twig' with { message: message, expanded: true } only %}
</turbo-frame>
